  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">A test per caller fails on origin/master: a Graph 503 on sendMail results in exactly one send attempt (the handler is not asked to retry) and the caller's existing failure outcome.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">A 429 is still retried per the handler's policy; a success still succeeds; EmailChannelSender is unchanged.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`git grep "SendMail.PostAsync" -- src` lists only callers that pass NoTransientRetryOption; build, filtered tests (Communication, SendEmailNode, MailboxVerification) and full ArchTests pass; publish-size delta reported.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>
